config BR2_PACKAGE_QT6DECLARATIVE
	bool "qt6declarative"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_QT6
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_QT6BASE
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_QT6BASE_GUI
	select BR2_PACKAGE_QT6BASE_NETWORK
	help
	  Qt6 QML/Quick module (Qt QML engine + Qt Quick scene graph).
	  B-4 移植: 迅为 SDK buildroot 无此包, 按上游 2024.08 移植。
	  B-5: 精简——原 9 个子选项(QMLCOMPILER/QMLSHAPES/QUICKCONTROLS等)
	  无 .mk 条件分支(死选项, 勾选无效), 删除; 包恒全量构建 Quick。

	  https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtdeclarative-index.html
